  "bio": "Christopher Perrin, based in Costa Mesa, United States, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the neotraditional style. His creative flair is matched by his unwavering professionalism, ensuring that each client's experience is as outstanding as the artwork they wear. Christopher's portfolio not only reflects his talent but also the meticulous cleanliness he upholds in his studio, setting a standard for the industry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Costa Mesa, California, United States\n\nThankful husband, proud father and humble follower of Jesus\n@lifeafterdeathtattoo @thankyoujesusbrand @resurrectionlifefamily",
